// ONCE Campfire (Rails 90b3300), the whole app, in crudspec v2 (docs/LANGUAGE-v2.md).
// Comments cite the Rails source where a rule isn't obvious. The v1 slice rule IDs
// (docs/RULE-INVENTORY.md) still appear where they apply.

// ======================================================================== data

enum Role { member, administrator, bot }                         // user/role.rb
enum UserStatus { active, deactivated, banned }
enum RoomType { open, closed, direct }
enum Involvement { invisible, nothing, mentions, everything }      // membership.rb

